    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/0e87d590a63d7d5835b685f8e6cdd293.avif?t=1748452269\" width=616 height=125 /></span><br><br>Welcome Morpi Keeper to the fast-paced card game you were waiting for!<br>Say goodbye to turns, think fast, and play the cards in your favor.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/f1ed9ec5b43420a8c5d4ceb50b332da1.webp?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/d33c5f29dc42c5d88924d4c7bb425d82.poster.avif?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/d33c5f29dc42c5d88924d4c7bb425d82.webm?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/d33c5f29dc42c5d88924d4c7bb425d82.mp4?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Meet your trusty and silly companions, the Morpis, ready to aid you in your battles<br>They may seem weak, but morpis can get stronger!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/2d5584f9e8b83780463a3bc00d836241.webp?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/89dfb9994dbb95a2610519a42b1645aa.poster.avif?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/89dfb9994dbb95a2610519a42b1645aa.webm?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/89dfb9994dbb95a2610519a42b1645aa.mp4?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Empower your Morpis with powerful skills by playing your cards strategically<br>Fireballs! Toxic attacks! Healing priest! VAMPIRE!?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/7c5691f18aa77d591e098e40a5292fe9.webp?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/12763ffa2d778cb1807b506d98ef6604.poster.avif?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/12763ffa2d778cb1807b506d98ef6604.webm?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/12763ffa2d778cb1807b506d98ef6604.mp4?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/d70a58abb0f4771e353d18a57ad3e1bc.poster.avif?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/d70a58abb0f4771e353d18a57ad3e1bc.webm?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/d70a58abb0f4771e353d18a57ad3e1bc.mp4?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Help your morpis in the battle with different actions<br>Move a morpi with a dash! Damage enemies with bombs! <br>Or maybe freeze them to get some time!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/5f41eff5ecfd8c4d37b84038d5cc0c1b.webp?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/89884f53aefab86b1ca09db411e3ea01.avif?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Gather coins to expand your card collection<br>Your morpis may need special skills to help you get coins fast<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/1f59efa444a8f7b62b901106db81db97.webp?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/aa2a5a1e210910860aed6957ddc84273.poster.avif?t=1748452269\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/aa2a5a1e210910860aed6957ddc84273.webm?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845820/extras/aa2a5a1e210910860aed6957ddc84273.mp4?t=1748452269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Mix Skills and Action to find simple and complex synergies!<br><br><br><strong>Don't forget to wishlist:)</strong><br><i>please!</i>",
